        ":question/difficulty": ":question.difficulty/moderate",
        ":question/problem": "Given $f(x)=2x^{3}+4x$ and $x\\ne 0$, calculate the integral.\n\n$\\displaystyle \\int \\frac{f(x)}{x^{3}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x=$\n{{field-1}}\n$+C.$",
